{"id":"wb-7-1737","name":"芜湖天主堂","title":"芜湖天主堂","status":"catalogue","text":"芜湖天主堂位于安徽省芜湖市镜湖区，是全国重点文物保护单位。名录记载的时代为清至民国，文物类型为近现代重要史迹及代表性建筑，本条按第七批名录收录。","sourceUrl":"http://www.ncha.gov.cn/module/download/downfile.jsp?classid=0&filename=1406261621052128423.pdf","sourceName":"公布名录","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4e3e5c3365e03c28946e0153.jpg","title":"芜湖天主堂20230124 09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8A%9C%E6%B9%96%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%A0%8220230124_09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/%E8%8A%9C%E6%B9%96%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%A0%8220230124_09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"西安兵马俑","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位芜湖天主堂","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}